SY_TALK("lvMTQOvAvfo",[[3,["Sahaja Culture and Ego","New Jersey Ashram, USA"]],[29,["October 26, 1985"]],[40,["Today I was thinking of talking, telling you","about the Sahaja Culture."]],[67,["Now we are formed in dharma, Vishwa Dharma."]],[74,["But it must have a culture."]],[77,["So far in all the religions there is no combination","of religion and culture."]],[85,["No religion has."]],[87,["That's why everywhere you find different cultures."]],[91,["Say in India, people who follow Hindu religion","have different cultures in different places."]],[97,["They are living in Lucknow, or say in U.P.,","they have a Muslim culture."]],[102,["More Islamic style."]],[105,["They'll eat in one plate, do all kinds of","things which normally a South Indian won't"]],[110,["do, and the South Indians have a different","culture from Maharashtrians."]],[115,["So even in a religion like Hindu religion","where culture is important, very important,"]],[122,["we find varieties."]],[124,["So the cultures get influenced by the neighboring","cultures or surrounding cultures, and that's"]],[130,["how people get lost."]],[135,["When you establish a religion like this, Vishwa","Dharma, it's not like any other religion."]],[140,["It's the real religion within us, and this","reality comes to us because now we are one"]],[147,["with the Spirit."]],[149,["So when we talk of Sahaja Culture, it is the","culture of the Spirit."]],[155,["Now what is a culture?"]],[156,["First of all let us see what is a culture","is."]],[158,["So the culture is the pattern of behavior","we have with others."]],[164,["Is a common pattern of behavior we are supposed","to have with others."]],[169,["Like in English language, for example, we'll","say \"Thank you\"."]],[174,["Even if somebody murders, you may say, \"Thank","you\"."]],[178,["Or the person who murders you can say, \"Sorry\"."]],[185,["On the phone one may say, just if they say","something you can't hear, \"Sorry?\""]],[190,["Every time, \"Sorry\"."]],[191,["As if \"sorry\" is a word so easily to be used."]],[193,["I mean if you are sorry, why are you sorry","for that?"]],[196,["\"Sorry?\""]],[197,["On the phone they used to first say, \"I beg","your pardon?\", was sensible; but now I find"]],[201,["everybody, A to Z, says, \"Sorry?\""]],[204,["I mean, it has no meaning, because what are","you sorry about?"]],[208,["Says \"Sorry?\""]],[209,["For everything they are sorry."]],[211,["Or we can say in English language, when we","speak, \"I'm afraid\"."]],[213,["You see, it's very common, \"I'm afraid\"."]],[215,["What are you afraid of?"]],[217,["The whole world is afraid of you."]],[219,["So this is the culture, what we talk of, any","culture as such, becomes artificial, is not"]],[228,["spontaneous, doesn't come from reality."]],[230,["It has no meaning; sometimes it is pointless,","absolutely pointless to stick to certain cultures."]],[237,["So the culture of the Spirit doesn't change."]],[241,["It's universal, and is higher than any other","culture."]],[247,["Apart from that it integrates all the essences","of all the cultures."]],[250,["So","it emanates from the spirit."]],[258,["Now, spirit has two sides."]],[262,["One side which you see, the another you don't","see, like the moon."]],[266,["The side you see is outside with other people,","other Sahaja Yogis, other people, other societies,"]],[272,["which are not yourself, absolutely."]],[280,["The other side you don't see is the relationship","with God Almighty, relationship with your"]],[288,["Mother."]],[289,["If the other side is not all right, the behavioral","side outside could become artificial, could"]],[298,["become crooked and not Sahaj."]],[302,["So it's the other way round than any other","culture."]],[306,["To know any other culture what do we go?"]],[308,["We see how they talk, what is their language,","how they speak, how they behave: all the outside"]],[313,["things we get."]],[315,["We must know \"thank you\" if we want to know","English language, must know \"thank you\", \"please\","]],[321,["all that."]],[323,["But if you want to know the Sahaja culture,","you have to know your Mother, and you have"]],[329,["to know God Almighty."]],[330,["And the relationship between your Mother and","the God Almighty has to be absolutely perfect."]],[338,["Then there's no problem."]],[341,["But that, the relationship, if it is not all","right, you cannot have artificial Sahaj culture."]],[349,["That is one thing for sure."]],[351,["Artificial Sahaj culture is not all right."]],[356,["I would say that India has, in its basics,","the culture of the spirit, India has; because"]],[363,["for traditions and traditions in India, and","for ages, people have been seeking the truth."]],[376,["Spiritually they are endowed, because of the","saints."]],[383,["They are blessed specially because they have","been seekers, not of material things, but"]],[391,["of the spirit."]],[393,["Specially in Maharashtra, we should say, because","the Kundalini is there always like a magnet."]],[401,["People are attracted because Shri Ganesha","being the magnet, attracted towards God and"]],[407,["spirit."]],[408,["So they form a pattern, but there is lot of","artificiality in that also has grown."]],[412,["We must admit that there is lot, lot of artificiality,","falsehood, nonsense that has grown into it,"]],[421,["because the religion fell into the hands of,","spiritual religion fell into the hands of"]],[427,["gross, horrible so-called Brahmins who were","not realized souls."]],[432,["So the whole culture has become so nonsensical","sometimes that you don't know where to look."]],[438,["But to have the culture, first of all, culture","is developed through meditation, by facing"]],[449,["yourself."]],[452,["First of all you should face yourself, how","you feel about your Mother and about God Almighty."]],[465,["First of all, how much liberty you take of","your Mother?"]],[472,["How much granted, take for granted your Mother?"]],[477,["She's a Mahamaya."]],[482,["Even the first \"M\" is difficult to understand."]],[486,["So when you start taking liberties, all the","time putting your pressure on Her, all the"]],[494,["time trying to attract Her attention, Her","time, or writing letters eleven pages, all"]],[504,["that, is one side."]],[506,["Another side is complete indifference to your","Mother."]],[512,["So it is to be known through your heart."]],[514,["You don't have to talk to Me."]],[517,["I know whose heart is pulsating."]],[521,["Perhaps I'm the only person who knows really","what you are."]],[527,["You may not be knowing yourself also."]],[530,["I may not say, but I know you in all details,","out of which I may say little bit, because"]],[539,["I am too gentle to say things."]],[543,["Because again of Sahaj culture."]],[546,["Because of Sahaj culture, I cannot say everything","to you on your face."]],[551,["I'm correcting it, trying to correct it, correct","it; if not possible, then I say to you."]],[557,["Then in that you have to also see how much","worshipful you are."]],[561,["Some people, though they spend more time with","Me, remain with Me, want to be with Me, it"]],[568,["is only when they feel surrendered, also."]],[573,["So it should not be confused: if somebody","is spending more time with Me, you should"]],[576,["not condemn yourself for that."]],[578,["It's all right."]],[580,["But how far you are surrendered is the point."]],[583,["Now, if you are surrendered, how do you see","the surrendering in a person?"]],[588,["You see it has one side and the another is","the expression."]],[594,["Say a person who is surrendered doesn't talk","much to Me, doesn't talk, he listens, doesn't"]],[604,["talk."]],[605,["Common sense, he listens."]],[610,["Even people who are very good, I've seen when","I'm talking, they'll put in their own words"]],[616,["in between."]],[619,["People who are very good, I should say."]],[621,["So the surrendering is not full."]],[624,["Then the time, they become very conscious","of the time."]],[626,["Who has made the time?"]],[631,["But the person won't come directly and tell","Me, but tell somebody else, \"Go and tell Mother,"]],[635,["She has to go at this time.\""]],[637,["I know everything, who tells whom, who goes","to whom, who is telling someone, who is time-bound."]],[646,["And then I flout it."]],[649,["I know what time to reach, what is the auspicious","time, how it will work out."]],[656,["Surrendering has to be to that point, that","you shouldn't worry."]],[659,["I would say Dumahl is one of them who is a","very great surrendered fellow."]],[664,["When I went there I was very tired, and he","said."]],[667,["\"Mother, if You want to rest You can rest.\""]],[669,["I said, \"Yes, I want to rest.\""]],[670,["So he just left Me alone."]],[672,["I was really very tired because I had a very","long journey, and then this and that, and"]],[677,["then I went down all the way there."]],[681,["I thought, \"I'll lie down, and sleep off."]],[684,["\" Of course, as I know that everything has","to be done at right time, I just went down."]],[691,["And we had a program of My reception at one","place in a village, and they were all waiting"]],[702,["for Me there."]],[705,["And I was sleeping; he wouldn't wake Me up."]],[706,["He wouldn't wake Me up."]],[707,["He said, \"Everything will be all right."]],[710,["Tell them when Mother will come.\""]],[713,["So there was sun on, they were all sitting","under the tree, sun was scorchingly hot."]],[718,["They were nicely having a nice nap under the","tree and all that."]],[723,["All the villagers arrived, everybody arrived,","everything worked out."]],[728,["And when I got up it was about five-thirty,","then he told Me that, \"Mother, I didn't tell"]],[732,["You the program.\""]],[733,["He never tells Me."]],[735,["If I get something written, well and good,","but, \"You were sleeping, I didn't want to"]],[739,["disturb You.\""]],[740,["\"What's the program?\""]],[741,["\"It was at three o'clock.\""]],[742,["I said, \"Three o'clock."]],[743,["Why didn't you tell Me?"]],[744,["Why didn't you wake Me?\""]],[746,["He said, \"You were awake, I knew You were","awake, Mother."]],[749,["It's all right.\""]],[750,["So we started off at six o'clock."]],[758,["Sun had gone down."]],[759,["By that time they arranged beautiful lights","and fireworks and everything, and all the"]],[766,["rushing about was finished, they're very well","settled."]],[770,["And the people from distant villages had also","arrived, and they had organized them so well,"]],[775,["and they had a proper time, and are very happy","that I came late because sun was not there,"]],[780,["so scorchingly hot."]],[782,["By the time we reached about seven o'clock","it was night and they illumined the lights,"]],[789,["and the diwali like this was put up everywhere,","and they got everything, they had sufficient"]],[795,["time to do everything."]],[796,["Then Dumahl said, \"I knew, Mother, You are","awake, and You were managing.\""]],[805,["If one can understand that, then you will","not try to organize Me."]],[809,["You can just tell Me, \"We have to leave at","this time.\""]],[813,["But if I don't have to leave, I will not leave","whatever you may do."]],[819,["In My own sweet way; you will never find Me","obstinate, but I am."]],[828,["Because I know what is right is what is right,","and has to be done that way."]],[831,["But otherwise I'm very calm, I am not bothered."]],[835,["I never organize you, I never hurry you, I","never do anything that should upset you."]],[841,["Spirit is never upset, never excited, never","hurries, and never is what you call that \"go-go\""]],[850,["business."]],[853,["Like now, we have to go to the airport."]],[854,["You'll find everybody was like an aeroplane","- round, round, round, round."]],[859,["What has happened?"]],[860,["\"Oh, we had to go?"]],[861,["We'd..\""]],[862,["\"We have to go, all right."]],[863,["So what?\""]],[864,["The whole thing is, all these excitements","and all these things come to us because we"]],[871,["are outside."]],[872,["But if you are one with your spirit you're","absolutely calm, absolutely calm, \"All right,"]],[874,["we have to go, all right, we'll reach there."]],[878,["Doesn't matter.\""]],[880,["The other day we had to go for some shopping,","I was trying to buy some saris for Indian"]],[885,["ladies."]],[886,["We got lost."]],[887,["I never bothered them at all."]],[889,["They were going round and round, and round","and round."]],[892,["And then Danny realized and said, \"I think","perhaps we had to leave vibrations in all"]],[896,["these places.\""]],[897,["I said, \"Correct.\""]],[898,["And for about two hours I think, we were roaming","about."]],[901,["Anybody else would be saying, \"What's this?"]],[903,["You can't find the place, what's the matter","with you?”"]],[906,["Calm."]],[907,["We reached the shop at the right time, got","everything at the right time, did everything,"]],[912,["came back at right time."]],[914,["Everything was first class, nothing went wrong."]],[917,["But anybody in My place, I tell you, that","time would have been, \"Oh God, this, that.\""]],[921,["Why are you saving time?"]],[922,["For what are you saving time?"]],[927,["So we miss the present, and that's one thing","spirit never misses."]],[931,["It's always in the present."]],[934,["That's the reality."]],[938,["Now in the West people are very futuristic,","extremely futuristic, and their futuristicness"]],[944,["sometimes takes them to points, say for example","if they have to go by train."]],[950,["So instead of arriving at the right station,","they'll go to the station which is further"]],[954,["on."]],[956,["And then again they'll arrive at the further","on."]],[957,["The train will never reach them."]],[960,["Sort of temperament they have."]],[963,["So one should not plan at all anything like","that, that fixes you."]],[970,["But at this moment, if I have to be told that","we have to go at this time, is all right,"]],[975,["finished now."]],[976,["At this moment I've told, is recorded, finished."]],[978,["All right?"]],[979,["So it's gone into the memory."]],[982,["There's nothing to worry about it now."]],[983,["Now, present moment, what are we doing?"]],[986,["In a very calm way, witness it."]],[990,["Witness yourself, now, witness yourself."]],[992,["\"Where is my mind going?\""]],[996,["Now somebody who has to cook must be thinking,","\"Oh, I have to get this, I have to get that.\""]],[1001,["Once you start saying that \"I have to do it\",","you'll never be able to do it that way."]],[1006,["But you said, \"All right, just now I'm in","meditation.\""]],[1013,["Every moment, \"I am in meditation.\""]],[1017,["Everything will walk up to you, even matter,","and you'll get the right things at the right"]],[1023,["place."]],[1026,["You'll meet right people at the right place."]],[1030,["The other day we were just walking, strolling","around."]],[1034,["Whom do we find there?"]],[1036,["Carolyn."]],[1037,["She just walked out."]],[1039,["There is she, I mean I met her."]],[1043,["She said, \"Christine is just next door.\""]],[1045,["I said, \"Let's go,\" and you should have seen","the joy on her face when she came down, and"]],[1049,["she saw Me."]],[1051,["Beautiful experience for Me and her, she was","so happy."]],[1055,["Then we went together."]],[1058,["So when you have so much tied down with your","watch, that means you are not tied down with"]],[1065,["your spirit."]],[1067,["So a Sahaja yogi, if he sees watch, then he's","not a Sahaja yogi."]],[1075,["But the other side could be that the Sahaja","yogis are never in time where they have to"]],[1080,["be."]],[1082,["Very common in England."]],[1084,["I reach always first, to open the door."]],[1088,["And to clean it also sometimes."]],[1096,["Now, to take for granted things, as you say,","take for granted, that's not the way Sahaja"]],[1104,["Yoga is."]],[1105,["You have to be alert, alert, absolutely alert."]],[1107,["If you are alert, immediately you'll know","\"I have to go now at this time."]],[1111,["I have to do it."]],[1114,["I have to get this thing now.\""]],[1118,["If you have to miss something, you are supposed","to miss it."]],[1121,["That's what it is."]],[1123,["So, there's a beautiful thing written down,","like they say, \"Jai sei rakhahu tase hi rahun\""]],[1128,["- \"The way You keep me, the way I am, will","be happy.\""]],[1133,["So, satisfaction towards yourself, your spirit,","is important."]],[1138,["Because ego will plan out, \"Oh, we'll go there,","we must get for Mother, say, daisies\", we"]],[1146,["decide."]],[1147,["\"Must get daisies.\""]],[1148,["You don't find daisies, you're disappointed."]],[1149,["Why not?"]],[1150,["These are all My flowers, whether they are","daisies or not, they look so nice."]],[1155,["Whatever you get, you get it."]],[1158,["That's the thing wanted."]],[1160,["You know that, that the Divine is working","out everything for you."]],[1166,["When you are supposed to get something else,","better have it."]],[1171,["Even by mistake, if I lay My hand upon some","things, like a book or something, immediately"]],[1179,["I'll open it out and see why this book has","come in My attention; why this fellow has"]],[1183,["come in My attention; why this is happening."]],[1187,["And immediately I find that there’s some","connection, something has to be done, something"]],[1193,["has to be said, something has to be worked","out."]],[1197,["So for a person who is imbibed with the culture","of spirit, the Sahaj culture, impresses others"]],[1208,["by his calmness and relaxed attitude."]],[1212,["Relaxation never means lethargy, by any chance."]],[1216,["It doesn't mean lethargy."]],[1218,["Lethargy is against relaxation."]],[1221,["A person who is relaxed cannot become lethargic."]],[1224,["\"Relaxed\" means a person who’s alert and","calm."]],[1230,["These two things for human beings is an impossibility,","because if they are alert, if they are alert"]],[1242,["then they're not calm."]],[1244,["If they're unhappy, sad, then they think they","are very, very calm."]],[1251,["So this is one of the things one has to remember,","that you have to witness yourself all the"]],[1255,["time."]],[1257,["Not to condemn yourself, but witness."]],[1259,["Now I said the word \"witness\" means \"detached\"."]],[1263,["Now what happens with this, when you start","condemning yourself, you miss every good point."]],[1268,["For example, you have some experience of a","sudden height being achieved."]],[1280,["All right?"]],[1281,["At that point you should catch hold of it,","hold on to it, keep doing, but don't forget"]],[1288,["that you may go back, no."]],[1292,["And then wait for another higher moment to","come, hold on to it."]],[1296,["That's how you climb Himalayas."]],[1299,["But not that, \"Oh Ma."]],[1301,["Now it's all right, but what will happen next?\""]],[1304,["Then you are gone down, because you have to","face yourself in the way, knowing what are"]],[1312,["your powers."]],[1313,["You are a spirit now, you are no more an ordinary","human being, so you have no business to condemn"]],[1317,["yourself, or to degrade yourself, or in any","way to feel unhappy."]],[1324,["No way."]],[1325,["Past is past."]],[1326,["What happened a moment before is finished."]],[1329,["\"Now I am going to rise."]],[1330,["Now I am going to rise.\""]],[1335,["So a person who has a Sahaja culture is not","only spontaneous, but is inspired, is a inspired"]],[1347,["personality."]],[1349,["A person who is of that kind, an inspired","visionary, then other people get impressed"]],[1360,["by such a person that, \"See, there's a man","who's inspired, who talks in an inspired way,"]],[1367,["in a way that is something very different","from others.\""]],[1372,["Something new he says, new that is nourishing."]],[1378,["Such a personality - like the other day, you","see, we heard the lectures of so many people,"]],[1385,["and when the New Zealand Prime Minister was","coming C.P. said, \"Now let's go back, because"]],[1391,["we'll have a little tea or something.\""]],[1393,["I said: \"No, you listen to this man."]],[1394,["He's a realized soul.\""]],[1395,["He said, \"Really?\""]],[1396,["I said, \"Yes, you listen to him.\""]],[1398,["First everybody was, \"He's sitting in New","Zealand, such a little titwit of a country,"]],[1402,["what is he going to speak?\""]],[1404,["You see, they were moving about, making a…"]],[1406,["Within two minutes he captured everybody's","attention, you see, and he was bubbling with"]],[1410,["everything, so beautifully, and he spoke all","the points so much different, and so much"]],[1417,["new and so much better."]],[1419,["C.P."]],[1420,["was amazed."]],[1421,["He said, \"How do You know?\""]],[1422,["I said, \"I know, because when I was in New","Zealand I told them he's a realized soul.\""]],[1427,["And our own Prime Minister is also a realized","soul."]],[1431,["You'll be surprised, after our Prime Minister","finished his lecture and all that, after two"]],[1434,["or three lectures he was to go; then he turned","round and went to this Australian [Shri Mataji"]],[1440,["may have meant New Zealand] Prime Minister,","only him, went and congratulated him, congratulated"]],[1445,["him."]],[1446,["Congratulated and said something very close","to him."]],[1449,["And the fellow again, you see, flew up into","joy."]],[1453,["We see it's all there."]],[1454,["And then he came away."]],[1456,["Why?"]],[1457,["Because one realized soul understands another","realized soul, and everybody was amazed: why"]],[1462,["did he turn to this man alone, and went and","congratulated him?"]],[1466,["So such a large country like India represented","by our Prime Minister, goes down all the way"]],[1474,["to a little country like New Zealand which","is nothing compared to India, and congratulates."]],[1479,["And that's a developed country, this is a","developing country."]],[1482,["Is something people did not understand."]],[1485,["And the whole joyous atmosphere both of them","shaking hands created."]],[1488,["This is Sahaja culture, in which you recognize","a realized soul, the dignity of a realized"]],[1498,["soul."]],[1499,["So when it comes to relating to others, first","and foremost are Sahaja yogis."]],[1505,["But I've seen most of the people are more","congenial with others, and less congenial"]],[1513,["with Sahaja yogis."]],[1515,["They try to criticize Sahaja yogis all the","time, and I test them."]],[1522,["I sometimes say, \"All right."]],[1523,["I don't think this fellow is very good\" and","all that."]],[1527,["But when the other person turns round and","shows compassion and says, \"No, Mother, I"]],[1531,["think it will work out\" then I like it."]],[1535,["I like that."]],[1537,["Or else sometimes I say, \"Oh, let them go","away."]],[1540,["There should be no more food for them, it's","all right.\""]],[1544,["No, Mother, we've made food for them.\""]],[1547,["So the culture of Sahaj is to give."]],[1552,["Give, and give, and give, and never ask for","a reward."]],[1558,["Never thinks, \"What I have to get\"."]],[1560,["After all, you have got the highest that anybody","could get."]],[1567,["They said the three heights a human being","can achieve in spirituality, which you all"]],[1573,["got in no time."]],[1575,["It's called as salokya, samipya, sanidya."]],[1582,["Salokya is that you should be able to see","God."]],[1587,["That you got."]],[1591,["Samipya is the closeness with God."]],[1598,["Sanidya is the togetherness, togetherness."]],[1603,["You have got all these three."]],[1612,["In one incarnation you've got it."]],[1615,["When Gods incarnated before, nobody knew that","they were Gods."]],[1628,["So even they got it, they never knew."]],[1632,["Very few people knew about them."]],[1638,["But even when Christ said He was the Son of","God, who, how many believed Him?"]],[1647,["They crucified Him."]],[1650,["Because they were not realized souls."]],[1653,["But by giving you realization I have given","you that capacity to get all these three blessings"]],[1658,["at one shot."]],[1660,["I speak your language, I speak your style,","I live with your style, and you understand"]],[1665,["Me."]],[1666,["There is no problem."]],[1668,["But with other Gods, imagine if I were Mahakali","today, what would have happened."]],[1673,["You would be all upside-down there hanging,","seeing Me from the other way round."]],[1680,["I don't know what would have happened - or","any one of them."]],[1685,["So the three blessings that a saint is promised,","you've got all of them."]],[1696,["But because you've got them, you don't understand."]],[1702,["You take it for granted."]],[1704,["There's no shraddha."]],[1707,["With this experience there should be tremendous","faith."]],[1715,["Faith is a thing that resides between Me and","you, in between."]],[1723,["Is we can say, the ocean of joy that is in","between."]],[1727,["Whatever I emit to you is that shraddha, and","when you are drenched into it, the joy of"]],[1740,["that shraddha makes everything so sahaj."]],[1748,["But for that you must open your hearts."]],[1755,["A Sahaja yogi who is secretive, who is insular,","who is jealous, who separates himself from"]],[1765,["others is no good."]],[1768,["Open your heart."]],[1771,["Give away your things, doesn't matter."]],[1777,["Matter has only one value, that it can communicate","your Sahaj culture."]],[1784,["Little things, you see, I see something that","you have got beautiful, and in My Mahamaya"]],[1799,["acting on Myself I say, \"Oh, that's very beautiful.\""]],[1803,["and then they say, \"Mother, You gave us this.\""]],[1812,["\"Ah, sorry.\""]],[1815,["And then I feel very ashamed of Myself, that","this is not Sahaj culture, you see."]],[1821,["But the joy is so much that I can't help it","sometimes I say, \"Oh, I - it's so beautiful,"]],[1824,["this one.\""]],[1826,["\"You gave us, Mother.\""]],[1830,["And the whole rapport and the whole feeling;","I feeling a little shy about it, and all,"]],[1835,["they're so beautiful, so dramatic; so dramatic","it is, so poetic."]],[1842,["Only at that point I feel ashamed of Myself."]],[1845,["Of course to be human being you should be","ashamed of yourself sometimes."]],[1852,["Otherwise the drama is not complete."]],[1853,["So the whole thing is so beautiful and so","joyous."]],[1860,["But that gentleness towards others and yourself","should be there."]],[1865,["Now if you become unhappy and serious, you","are very unkind to yourself and to others."]],[1871,["Anybody who is a serious person, sits with","a serious face, know that he is not a Sahaja"]],[1877,["yogi at all."]],[1879,["They should be bubbling with laughter, joy","all the time."]],[1882,["I cannot be serious for more than, I think,","five seconds perhaps."]],[1887,["I don't know."]],[1890,["I try, because lectures should be serious","to go into the hearts of the people."]],[1894,["But there's not, and you can see that even","when I'm getting angry, My eyes betray Me,"]],[1901,["and there's a twinkle of laughter in the eyes."]],[1907,["That's how a person should be, and don't worry","what others have to say."]],[1912,["You see, the culture where people are just","glum like this, is the same as the people"]],[1918,["where they are frivolous."]],[1920,["Now as we can say American culture is to be","frivolous, stupid, you see, I won't be surprised"]],[1928,["supposing your Prime Minister tomorrow starts","wearing a sari, just to amuse you."]],[1931,["Anything is possible with them, just to amuse","you, you see, too - for cheap popularity."]],[1940,["Anything frivolous, stupid, they will do."]],[1942,["But supposing, you see, it is say an English","old conservative personality, then a lady"]],[1950,["might wear a very official dress with the","lines and this and that, and like a man she"]],[1959,["might become very soon, like that, develop","a very serious face."]],[1965,["But both things are nonsensical, has no meaning."]],[1968,["You have to be natural, and natural everything","is always bubbling with joy."]],[1976,["And a message."]],[1978,["And a message."]],[1979,["These flowers are the message of My coming,","writ large on them."]],[1986,["So a person who is a Sahaj culture man should","emit that message to others, people should"]],[1994,["see, \"Oh, this is the man."]],[1996,["He is the sahaja fellow.\""]],[1998,["You can see that clearly."]],[1999,["There's no seriousness, there's no unhappiness,","nothing."]],[2001,["Supposing I have said something that might","be upsetting you, forget it."]],[2007,["If you cannot forget that, then you have not","listened to Me."]],[2013,["But \"forget\" doesn't mean that you do not","act upon it."]],[2016,["\"Acting upon it\" means that you face yourself","and see for yourself how you have ascended"]],[2022,["and how far you have to go, not how you'll","fall down."]],[2025,["So it is all the time acting on both sides,","as I'm telling you in My lecture, that on"]],[2031,["one side you'll see to yourself as relationship","with Me, and relationship with others."]],[2037,["For a Sahaja yogi it should not matter whether","you are in a palace or on the street."]],[2051,["The first encounter with the first Sahaja","yogis - we have only one surviving, now here"]],[2055,["sitting down - they couldn't bear, for them","it was difficult to be in the beautiful atmosphere"]],[2062,["of India."]],[2063,["The reason is, they were analyzing: they have","no good bathrooms, no showers."]],[2069,["But you have the whole sky."]],[2073,["You have all the mountains."]],[2075,["You have all the trees."]],[2077,["You have got all the waters flowing."]],[2080,["But you want to have a little shower, in which","you can't even move."]],[2086,["Just an idea, just an idea of comfort."]],[2093,["You have no comforts, if you ask Me, compared","to what we have in India."]],[2099,["No comforts at all."]],[2101,["I mean, ask any Indian girl to come and stay,","she will cry."]],[2107,["Even I think here the President, the President","has to wash his utensils perhaps, maybe."]],[2113,["What a comfort."]],[2115,["There's no division of labor."]],[2118,["Now in our country we have servants, but \"servants\"","doesn't mean that we cheat them anything else."]],[2123,["They eat the same food as we eat."]],[2126,["They live the same way we live."]],[2128,["But they do different type of work, because","they don't have the same mental capacity to"]],[2132,["be the President."]],[2134,["The President does some other work."]],[2139,["You have no comfort of any kind, you take","it from Me."]],[2142,["Food matter, you get everything processed","food."]],[2145,["Imagine, any time you might be developing","cancer due to processed food."]],[2150,["What is your speciality then?"]],[2153,["Try to understand."]],[2154,["What is the kind of food: it's not fresh,","God knows how it is processed, how it is preserved,"]],[2160,["from where it is coming."]],[2161,["Suddenly in London they said that, \"Don't","eat this kind of food,\" you see, \"because"]],[2167,["it has got something contaminated.\""]],[2169,["So everybody rushes, you see, to the store","room, because we have to store up all these"]],[2173,["things."]],[2174,["You can't get at the right…."]],[2175,["\"Oh it's there\"; then you start throwing them","out."]],[2179,["It's a mad racing because people think that,","\"God knows what we are eating today, is it"]],[2189,["correct or not?\""]],[2190,["So food-wise you are zero."]],[2194,["Best thing is to live in the villages or in","the forests, to get the fresh fruits, wash"]],[2201,["them in clean flowing water of a river, eat","it nicely and sit down enjoying the sun."]],[2211,["The comfort of the spirit is the thing we","have lost, and those who seek the comfort"]],[2218,["of the spirit are Sahaja yogis, not otherwise."]],[2224,["Comfort of the spirit comes in giving."]],[2228,["Say I've borrowed some money from you, I won't","be comfortable till I've paid you back."]],[2235,["Going further with it, supposing you are caught","up into something, you have got some problems."]],[2242,["I'll somehow or other manage that you'll come","close to Me somewhere, and work it out on"]],[2246,["you, clear you out, finished."]],[2248,["Till then I won't be comfortable; though I'll","suffer, I'll have pains, I'll have this, that."]],[2253,["As soon as I came here, left Nabhi was like","this going on."]],[2257,["Corrected it."]],[2258,["I took it upon Myself, I sucked it into Me."]],[2261,["So they are adventurous."]],[2264,["\"Oh I will not touch, I am catching, he's","catching.\""]],[2270,["Finished."]],[2271,["But now the compassion can only work out if","you have that kind of a spirit, otherwise"]],[2275,["you cannot."]],[2277,["It becomes sympathy."]],[2278,["For example there's one person, Mr. A. or","Miss A. or Mrs. A., whatever it is."]],[2284,["I mean, I'm just talking of a common personality,","and that person is catching."]],[2289,["I would say in an ashram, that person should","clear out."]],[2293,["But all the ashramites will catch from that","person, and that person will never be all"]],[2299,["right."]],[2300,["There's a very nice joke about it."]],[2303,["There was a lady, she wanted to reduce herself."]],[2306,["So there was a machine like a rolling-pin."]],[2309,["They said, \"If you rub it, then you will reduce.\""]],[2313,["So she brought, poor thing, she brought the","machine and she started rolling it."]],[2317,["She found that the rolling-pin became fat,","instead of she reducing."]],[2328,["Same thing is in Sahaja yoga."]],[2333,["Instead of Sahaja yogis correcting the others,","they get contaminated."]],[2336,["That's why I said, \"Don't have anybody in","the ashram.\""]],[2338,["Because you sympathize."]],[2341,["You do not try to correct that person, in","a way that you can correct within yourselves,"]],[2347,["suck it within yourself as your Mother does,","and do it."]],[2349,["I do it for thousands and thousands and thousands;","you have to do it for one or two, so you are"]],[2354,["never bothered."]],[2355,["And that's how you become strong."]],[2357,["Not by shunning them, running away from them","or condemning yourself, or saying that: \"We"]],[2361,["must save ourselves on the boat.\""]],[2366,["No."]],[2367,["Through adventure."]],[2368,["\"Let's see what happens\"."]],[2370,["Tamara was telling Me, \"Nothing catches me,","Mother, what is it?\""]],[2373,["I said: \"But who will catch you?"]],[2375,["Those who will catch will be hurt themselves.\""]],[2381,["So what is it, that Bhairava is to be established."]],[2385,["Sidha kala mane Bhairav' - as you have to","establish Shri Ganesha, you have to establish"]],[2391,["also Bhairava, and Hanumana on the right side."]],[2394,["If these three deities you establish within","yourself, nothing, nothing on this earth can"]],[2400,["catch you."]],[2401,["You'll catch it for a while."]],[2405,["But what I find now, I came to this ashram,","everybody's left Nabhi caught up."]],[2408,["Everybody's left Agnya caught up."]],[2413,["So then I get the pain."]],[2414,["Everyone."]],[2415,["I mean, I have put you inside My body, do","you know that?"]],[2418,["You are part and parcel of My body, you are","the cells in My body."]],[2424,["And when you catch, I also catch; not catch,","but I really get the pain, but I clear it."]],[2433,["In the same way, I have given you powers."]],[2436,["Every power I have, I have given you."]],[2443,["But you have to develop it and you have to","be adventurous."]],[2451,["But on the contrary, once we have ashrams,","everybody settles down, \"Oh, now, very comfortable,"]],[2456,["very cheap.\""]],[2457,["Very economical, that's the first comfort."]],[2460,["It's surprising, for a Western person, it","is very important that it should be economical,"]],[2471,["surprising, affluent people think more of","saving money than the people who are poor."]],[2479,["And English are the last word, save pounds,","at the cost of others."]],[2488,["On the contrary if you go to India, where","they’ll be very happy, they'll invite you"]],[2492,["in their house."]],[2493,["Whatever they have they will give it to you,","\"Eat, eat, eat.\""]],[2497,["They'll force you."]],[2498,["They'll be very happy to give."]],[2500,["But in England it's very dangerous, you see."]],[2503,["Sometimes in the ashram they may not even","have food for Me."]],[2507,["Really."]],[2508,["And if you tell them, \"I know."]],[2511,["I know.\""]],[2512,["You know."]],[2513,["Finished."]],[2514,["Then what do you say?"]],[2515,["They already know it, now what to do?"]],[2517,["They know."]],[2518,["So with the affluence miserliness grows, and","money-orientation."]],[2526,["In India also I've seen people who get little","more money than the rest become very money-oriented."]],[2531,["Money becomes everything, money becomes the","power, money becomes their life."]],[2536,["Sahaja yogi doesn't care for money."]],[2540,["Just.. is the dust of our Mother's feet."]],[2545,["What is money, what is wealth?"]],[2548,["And when they do like that, then their money","problems are solved."]],[2553,["If you have a money problem, know that there's","a problem."]],[2556,["If you are very particular about money."]],[2562,["I am, in a way, because if I have to give","somebody, I remember it."]],[2567,["But I've seen people who are very anxious","to tell Me that, \"You have to pay this man"]],[2571,["so much, that man so much.\""]],[2572,["That's wrong."]],[2573,["That's not your look-out."]],[2575,["That's very, very wrong to tell Me that, \"You","have to pay this man or that man.\""]],[2580,["It's not important."]],[2582,["Even if I don't pay, I pay him."]],[2586,["So in relationship with Me, you are not to","tell Me that, \"You have to pay so much money"]],[2592,["to him, this much money should be paid, this","is what he owes You.\""]],[2596,["Nothing of the kind."]],[2597,["Let the person come and tell Me."]],[2600,["Why are you telling?"]],[2601,["That kind of a message if you give Me, you","are lost."]],[2606,["Or if you come and tell Me for somebody else","that, \"Mother, time is up, we have to go."]],[2611,["Somebody is hurrying You up.\""]],[2613,["If somebody is hurrying Me, tell him, \"Don't","hurry Mother.\""]],[2620,["You must know that your kundalinis were not","raised with just your own kundalini, but something"]],[2632,["that is working it out."]],[2633,["Something very tremendous, a big organization."]],[2638,["You can't see it, it is microscopic."]],[2642,["You must know, nobody got realization like","that, did they?"]],[2646,["Thousands getting realization, what's happening?"]],[2648,["There must be something about…"]],[2651,["Now how can you tell anything to such an organization?"]],[2656,["They don't like it."]],[2657,["They know it."]],[2659,["Actually they are the ones who know, not the","English."]],[2663,["They know what is to be done."]],[2666,["So your relationship with Me acts as your","culture."]],[2672,["So it is a Mother's cult, you can call it,","the Mother's culture."]],[2679,["How we are connected with our Mother."]],[2681,["I have seen people, if somebody is rude to","them, they get very angry."]],[2688,["But if somebody is rude to Me they don't feel","angry."]],[2692,["It should be the other way round."]],[2696,["Now I'll give you an example."]],[2699,["This Merv Griffin was funny, and both our","PRO’s were very angry."]],[2705,["It was natural and very…"]],[2707,["I mean, I liked it, but I calmed them down."]],[2710,["And Worlikar of course was on top of this","thing."]],[2712,["But the other fellow would not."]],[2715,["He was giving arguments."]],[2719,["I was just watching."]],[2720,["I mean, if somebody had said this to his mother..."]],[2724,["There's another one there, he never came to","receive Me at the airport."]],[2732,["So Worlikar said, \"If your own mother had","come, you would not have gone?\""]],[2742,["Then one can give explanation, \"Oh, but our","Mother is Adi Shakti."]],[2746,["My mother is not, she's helpless.\""]],[2748,["It's not."]],[2749,["To show your respect, to show your love, you","have to go; for your own gain, not for Her"]],[2754,["gain."]],[2755,["For your own gain."]],[2759,["This relationship is for your own gain."]],[2763,["Supposing if you strike oil, is it for your","gain or for the gain of the oil?"]],[2772,["If you get to the Source, is it for the Source","to gain anything, or it is for you to gain"]],[2779,["anything?"]],[2780,["Logic, simple logic."]],[2783,["So in that culture, you see, you really thrive","and you become extremely a happy person, a"]],[2792,["joyous person."]],[2794,["And the expression of such a person is so","different, because such a person, as I told"]],[2804,["you, rises above and sees the problems of","others, the decadence of the society, sees"]],[2810,["all the problems of the world."]],[2816,["Not only that, but knows the solutions."]],[2820,["We are not like these ordinary people who","have racialism, this.. other diseases, I don't"]],[2829,["know what sort of diseases they have, I also","forget."]],[2832,["Racialism now, it's another stupid nonsense,","you know."]],[2835,["What is racialism?"]],[2837,["God has made somebody's color like this and","somebody's color like that, and those same"]],[2842,["racists are trying to tan their faces."]],[2854,["So in this culture of ours we are not bothered","about superficial things."]],[2861,["What we are bothered about is our inner cleanliness,","inner beauty, but that doesn't mean that you"]],[2870,["should move about like primitive people, no."]],[2875,["But if there is inner beauty, then outer beauty","comes."]],[2878,["You will never find Me dirtily dressed."]],[2881,["You will never find Me without a sari on,","even when I sleep I wear a sari, because in"]],[2887,["the night also I have to work, so how can","I go in My dressing-gown to the other world?"]],[2898,["So a person who is a Sahaja yogi has to be","an extremely neat and a clean person, but"]],[2905,["not to tell others, but should be himself","or herself."]],[2908,["That's one of the things are very important,","because others will see you, like loonies,"]],[2913,["who's going to believe you?"]],[2916,["So the one effect is from the Mother, you","take from the Source, for what?"]],[2922,["To be that illuminated quality, in you, so","that others see you as something great and"]],[2931,["adore you, worship you."]],[2935,["This is this far we have come, now, how your","personality should be."]],[2940,["But now, when you are dealing with others,","know that they are human beings made by God,"]],[2946,["not by Sahaja yogis by any chance."]],[2951,["And they will be tomorrow's Sahaja yogis,","may be higher Sahaja yogis than you."]],[2956,["So when we are dealing with others also, talk","to them in a gentle way."]],[2963,["Be kind to them."]],[2964,["Of course we are against gurus, against cults,","against all these people."]],[2967,["But as soon as they come, if you say: \"Oh,","you are a bhoot\", the person will do right-about-turn"]],[2975,["and go away."]],[2979,["So you are not given this power to be abrupt","or to be arrogant with others, not given."]],[2990,["Now all such people are coming down, calming","down because they see that what helps is your"]],[2997,["gentle, kindly, firm attitude."]],[3002,["Only after Sahaja Yoga you can combine all","these qualities."]],[3005,["You'll be firm, you'll be alert, you'll be","gentle and compassionate, smiling, but not"]],[3014,["making fun of others."]],[3016,["So then you become a personality who is alert:","to see what is the reaction they're having"]],[3026,["on others, this is very important to be seen."]],[3029,["So now you start witnessing others."]],[3032,["What is your reaction on others?"]],[3034,["I have seen many a times, a new Sahaja yogi","comes in."]],[3040,["The person is trying to say something, and","the girl starts giggling or laughing."]],[3047,["One should not, at that time, because the","person might think that, \"They're making fool"]],[3052,["of me, or they're thinking that I'm a stupid","person, or something wrong with me.\""]],[3057,["That person will become self-conscious, I","won't be able to give realization to that"]],[3061,["person."]],[3062,["But if somebody is sitting before Me and I'm","trying to help that person, know that it's"]],[3069,["a very important moment of this gentleman's","life."]],[3076,["We have got it, so what?"]],[3078,["When we are pulling out somebody, when we","are helping out somebody, do we laugh?"]],[3085,["That's the time you have to be very concerned","and very much serious, to do the job."]],[3094,["Every quality and mood has its own place,","like nose is at its own place, eyes at its"]],[3099,["own place."]],[3100,["In the same way, all these moods that we have,","have their own places."]],[3110,["And that is what is lost in modern society."]],[3115,["So when I am trying to help somebody, you","should be all concern about that person."]],[3123,["How does this come in to us from the Source?"]],[3126,["How much you are concerned about Me?"]],[3129,["Supposing I am thirsty, you will feel thirsty."]],[3136,["You'll immediately say, \"Mother, I'll get","You some water.\""]],[3139,["But you may not even ask Me, just bring it","here, keep it there."]],[3143,["Or just make some tea for Me or look after","Me."]],[3146,["Do this or do that."]],[3149,["In little, little things you should watch."]],[3152,["The concern is not in saying something, asking","something."]],[3156,["You don't ask."]],[3157,["Don't ask Mother, you just do it."]],[3167,["That's how, when you start doing it, you will","understand what you are doing to others."]],[3171,["So the reflection on others, how they reflect","about you also is very important, and you"]],[3179,["have to be alert."]],[3183,["Suddenly you say something, and everybody","disappears."]],[3186,["You must know they are not yet Sahaja yogis,","they are to be brought in, so you have to"]],[3190,["very carefully bring them around."]],[3196,["Then with Sahaja yogis, among yourselves how","you behave is extremely important for others"]],[3203,["to see."]],[3205,["We must cherish each other's company, we must","cherish."]],[3213,["To meet some Sahaja yogi somewhere, \"Ah, what","a joy it is to see someone, to talk to someone"]],[3218,["on the phone.\""]],[3219,["But because we are so insular, so selfish,","so greedy, and sometimes very circumcised"]],[3226,["[should read 'circumscribed'] I should say,","or absolutely engulfed into our past, we cannot"]],[3235,["do that, we do not feel that joy, we cannot","adore another Sahaja yogi, we do not enjoy"]],[3242,["another Sahaja yogi, we cannot cherish his","company."]],[3248,["That means this finger cannot feel this finger."]],[3252,["It's like a developing, what you call, a disease","called leprosy."]],[3257,["Nerves are finished."]],[3260,["Nerve endings are not there."]],[3262,["You cannot feel the joy of other Sahaja yogis."]],[3271,["And this is only possible if you get over","your personal interests."]],[3278,["When people come in Sahaja Yoga in the beginning,","they have personal interests, like say somebody"]],[3286,["is trying to sell something, so they would","like to sell it to Sahaja yogis."]],[3294,["Or they are arranging something, they would","like Sahaja yogis to do it."]],[3298,["See, personal interest, to use Sahaja yogis","for their own purposes."]],[3302,["As a result of that I've seen some people","become so insular that nobody helps them,"]],[3311,["no work is done by them; if there's a telephone,","nobody will say, \"I'll get it.\""]],[3315,["That's American quality, they'll say, \"I'll","get it.\""]],[3318,["Is regarded good."]],[3320,["Not in England, they'll be all sitting, quiet."]],[3327,["Even when they have eaten the food, they have","to pay the money, they'll look this side,"]],[3332,["and some poor Indian student will pay for","all of them."]],[3336,["\"I won't look\", they say."]],[3338,["\"Now paid.\""]],[3339,["Now they are normal."]],[3340,["It's very low-level."]],[3344,["Is extremely low-level behavior."]],[3350,["And this is what one has to learn, that you","have to cherish others, give presents to others."]],[3362,["\"You're going there; “Oh, now…\"; like","the other day I met a lady, she had liked"]],[3371,["one of My rings of emerald."]],[3375,["That's My family ring so I can't give away,","you see, I'll have to ask C.P. and he may"]],[3382,["not like it, because after all I have no right","on it, I have to give it to My children, all"]],[3387,["right?"]],[3388,["But I found an emerald somewhere, beautiful,","so I kept it with Me."]],[3392,["The other day when I gave her, she was so","enamored."]],[3394,["I said, \"You liked My ring, I couldn't give","you My ring, so..\""]],[3398,["She said to Me, \"You mean to say, I would","have taken Your ring?\""]],[3401,["I said, \"I would have forced it on you, but","I couldn't give you, so I thought of it."]],[3406,["I just saw it somewhere so I got it for you.\""]],[3408,["She said, \"How thoughtful.\""]],[3409,["But it's all in My head."]],[3413,["I, whenever I get it, a chance, you see, so","somebody says, \"Oh, I like it\", keep it in"]],[3422,["mind."]],[3423,["Next time, even a flower."]],[3426,["You must cherish their companies, because","it's such a great thing to have somebody who"]],[3431,["understands you, your spirit, and they have","the spirit."]],[3434,["Such a great thing."]],[3436,["How can you be unkind to each other?"]],[3441,["That hurts Me the most of all."]],[3444,["And the first thing and the foremost thing","you have to give Me is congenial, beautiful,"]],[3453,["loving group, that they love each other."]],[3461,["If that's achieved, that you really love,","beyond your personal considerations."]],[3466,["I mean, of course, in Sahaja Yoga there are","now not many people who try to make money,"]],[3473,["but try to make comfort for themselves."]],[3475,["They must have the best room, they must have","the best place, they must have..."]],[3479,["\"I didn't get this, I should have it, this,","that.\""]],[3482,["Try to do more than others."]],[3483,["I know sometimes people take advantage of","you, but they will go out of Sahaja Yoga very"]],[3489,["soon."]],[3490,["So be sure that you become generous about","it, very generous."]],[3495,["And generosity should start from your own","Sahaja yogi brothers and sisters."]],[3506,["In the culture of Sahaja Yoga we have to have","a full imbibement bubbling through our nerves,"]],[3516,["the sense of chastity."]],[3520,["That is a must, whether you like it or not."]],[3525,["There should be no bad intentions about any","other person, of relationships which are not"]],[3537,["pure."]],[3538,["Absolutely pure relationships, pure eyes without","any adultery, adulteration I would call it."]],[3551,["Clean eyes is the basic of Sahaja Yoga."]],[3560,["Steadfast clean eyes, because your eyes are","very powerful."]],[3567,["You don't know how powerful they are."]],[3572,["So to make it that way, to practice, move","your attention inward and towards the Sahasrara."]],[3584,["You can."]],[3585,["With your eyes you suck in."]],[3590,["Even by looking at Me with the shraddha, with","the joy, you just suck it inside, My image."]],[3597,["Put it on your Sahasrara, put it in your heart,","you can do it."]],[3605,["It's very joy giving."]],[3607,["When you put it in the Sahasrara, then you","get the knowledge."]],[3613,["When you put it in your heart, you get the","joy; and when you put it on your liver, then"]],[3620,["you get the power of action."]],[3626,["From the photograph also you can do it, suck","in, move it."]],[3632,["But that is shown in the way you behave towards","others, completely confident, gentle; no arrogance."]],[3643,["Neither the neck up like that or like that,","but in the center in a very dignified manner."]],[3655,["So in the culture of Sahaj, because the spirit","is the dignity, is the majesty, is the glory"]],[3670,["of God, you have to judge yourself."]],[3674,["\"Did I say something which is not respecting","my spirit?"]],[3680,["Did I do something that is not glorious?\""]],[3687,["Like I've seen people, when I'm there, they'll","go on asking Me hundred questions."]],[3691,["\"Should it be white towel?"]],[3693,["Green towel?"]],[3694,["Should I do this, should I do that?\""]],[3699,["Why?"]],[3700,["Because we don't live with choices."]],[3702,["We live with whatever we get it, and there","is dignity in that."]],[3708,["If you start doing choices, it's stupid."]],[3714,["In a group of Sahaja yogis, the food, \"What","will you have?\""]],[3719,["They'll take forty-five minutes to decide,","if you go in a restaurant, because the first,"]],[3723,["the consciousness, \"We are paying for it\",","and somebody will have this, somebody will"]],[3728,["have that."]],[3729,["The poor waiter will run away."]],[3731,["But why should we have different?"]],[3734,["It's just the same."]],[3738,["Whatever Mother is having we'll have, finished."]],[3746,["But if not that, at least whatever everybody","is having, \"Why have separately?\""]],[3749,["Choices are not there in Sahaja Yoga, remember","this word very clearly."]],[3754,["Choices of this, choices of that, I don't","like it, I like that."]],[3757,["This is not good, that is not good."]],[3762,["Because we need everything on the level of","vibrations, then the choice is coming."]],[3770,["Like, if the vibrations are not good we'll","not say it, but we'll not have it."]],[3780,["But not question of whether green or red or","yellow or white."]],[3785,["And that is what they are making fool out","of you."]],[3789,["They will put one name, Cartier, finished."]],[3795,["People will pay any amount for that Cartier."]],[3798,["Is any ordinary stuff, it is nothing special."]],[3803,["But you see that ego, \"I've got the Cartier."]],[3806,["I paid more to show that I've paid more, that","I've been a fool.\""]],[3811,["To pay more for something that's so cheapish;","that's what they're playing upon - remember"]],[3819,["that."]],[3820,["So you have to understand that when you are","a Sahaj personality, you have your own dignity."]],[3828,["These things do not give dignity to you."]],[3831,["You give them dignity."]],[3838,["But that doesn't mean tomorrow you come like","a clown, or like a limbo on your nose."]],[3847,["Of course I must see the other point always,","because it just slips out that side."]],[3852,["When you become dignified, you will wear always","something that is dignified."]],[3860,["You will do all that is dignified."]],[3862,["Is automatically you become dignified."]],[3864,["It's nothing artificial."]],[3868,["So dignity that comes, as you see your Mother."]],[3875,["Whatever you give Me in Puja I take it, all","right, but otherwise you cannot give Me anything"]],[3882,["else."]],[3883,["If you give Me, I'll return it, somehow."]],[3889,["Somehow I'll return it."]],[3892,["A person who is money-oriented cannot have","dignity, because you see him like a beggar."]],[3898,["See, if there’s money-orientation is too","much, he comes down to that level, you can"]],[3902,["see it, there cannot be dignity there."]],[3904,["A man who is power-oriented is an idiot."]],[3909,["He looks like an idiot."]],[3911,["So we cannot become idiots."]],[3913,["All right."]],[3914,["So we cannot be power-oriented."]],[3916,["The one who is sort of a romantic or a love-oriented,","is a stupid fellow."]],[3924,["He behaves like a stupid fellow."]],[3927,["On the street they go on kissing each other","all the time."]],[3930,["\"Where are you going?\""]],[3932,["\"To the divorce case, but last bit we are","thinking of having some kisses.\""]],[3939,["Self-respect is the thing."]],[3942,["Self is your spirit."]],[3944,["The respect of the spirit should give you","that dignity."]],[3947,["But in privacy you are gentle with your husband,","you are gentle with your wife."]],[3953,["You must learn how to be gentle with her in","privacy, not in public."]],[3960,["That's horrible."]],[3962,["Specially in India."]],[3963,["I am told that people go round with that romanticism","and all that."]],[3967,["So please, don't do all those romantic stuff","in India, it's very embarrassing for Me, very"]],[3973,["embarrassing."]],[3975,["So we cannot do things which embarrasses our","Mother."]],[3980,["Once you start knowing that, \"This will embarrass","Mother, we can't do this\", automatically you"]],[3984,["are helping."]],[3985,["So when it is related with Me, immediately,","\"What will Mother think of in me?"]],[3992,["Is this the way to behave towards Mother?\""]],[3994,["Immediately you will get the reward, as that","thing working through you, as if you become"]],[4006,["that nature."]],[4007,["Sahaja culture is a sahaja nature."]],[4010,["Automatically you will do it."]],[4013,["You'll talk in that manner, you will speak","in that manner, you’ll live in that manner."]],[4020,["I mean, I have seen people who have never","known Me, on a trunk call or a telephone,"]],[4027,["they recognize."]],[4028,["They know I am something special; if they","are sensitive enough."]],[4033,["From My photograph, the way I sit, the way","I talk, immediately everyone asks."]],[4037,["The other day where I went for the meeting","with My husband, everybody was asking, \"Who"]],[4041,["is this lady?\""]],[4042,["\"Who is this lady?\""]],[4043,["\"Who is this lady?\""]],[4047,["There's something in the personality."]],[4049,["I talk to everyone nicely, I'm very sweet."]],[4055,["We cannot be slavish, and we cannot enslave","anyone."]],[4059,["We have to cherish, even human beings we have","to cherish, because they are us."]],[4067,["Not to despise anyone, not to laugh at anyone."]],[4073,["In the culture of Sahaj, you have to become","an expert: expertise."]],[4079,["Expertise comes through your adherence to","your Mother."]],[4087,["Expertise: you all should be an expert, and","who will give you the certificate is your"]],[4092,["Mother only - who else?"]],[4094,["I may not say so, but your spirit will say","that, and not your ego."]],[4103,["In this short time whatever was possible,","it's such a big subject, culture is; you cannot."]],[4110,["But I've talked to you, I would not say in","a very analytical way, but in a very synthetic"]],[4116,["manner."]],[4119,["So I've given you very synthesis of the whole","thing."]],[4121,["\"Analytical\" would be one, two, three, four,","five - cut short - two, three, four, five,"]],[4128,["like that."]],[4129,["It's not like that."]],[4131,["And that is how you have to speak to people."]],[4134,["One, this is so; two, this is so; three, this","is so; finished."]],[4139,["You are not Sahaja yogis."]],[4141,["In your speeches if you talk like that, finished."]],[4148,["But before saying something or doing something,","give a little idea where you are leading the"]],[4154,["people, so they are not frittered away, attention","is not frittered away."]],[4160,["Give a little idea, as I say, or else while","talking, bring them to a point which is important,"]],[4172,["so that they wait in the sentence to come","to that point."]],[4178,["But make the whole sentence look so, that","it is going towards certain points, so always"]],[4185,["a Sahaja yogi must make a point out of what","they talk, not just babbling, talking."]],[4194,["What is the point you are going to make?"]],[4198,["Whatever they do, they have to know, \"What","are we going to achieve out of it?\""]],[4204,["Now, marriage."]],[4205,["\"What are we going to achieve out of marriage?\""]],[4207,["A family, house, everybody has, even a donkey","has that."]],[4211,["What's so great?"]],[4213,["We are going to achieve a family unit where","realized souls are to be born, we're going"]],[4219,["to look after them in a proper way, and then","we are going to emit that unit into this world,"]],[4231,["like a sparkling diamond set in the beautiful","setting of a family, giving light to the whole"]],[4239,["world."]],[4242,["So one's life should not be pointless, and","talk should not be pointless, and every moment"]],[4252,["should be filled with achievements of your","visions and dreams, slowly and steadily, which"]],[4263,["is not at all difficult."]],[4269,["If you can get rid of ego and superego, finished,","that's all - simple as that."]],[4275,["May God bless you all."]],[4285,["Mm.. good.. nice.. relaxed, eh?"]],[4295,["Relaxed."]],[4297,["Witness."]],[4299,["Everyone cleared out, I think."]],[4309,["And no more…"]],[4310,["one more thing I must say last, as I've said","it before, which I've not said here, no-one"]],[4316,["is going to say that bhoot did it, because","such a person will be sent away to the bhoot"]],[4321,["clan, not to Sahaja Yoga."]],[4325,["Don't put your responsibility on the bhoots."]],[4329,["Either you are a bhoot or you are a Sahaja","yogi, one of the two, you can't be both."]]]);
